{"4361240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Radiance of Souls", "steam_appid": 4361240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/3000d3df27fbbd57420c5017b71f6bac.poster.avif?t=1775059936\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/3000d3df27fbbd57420c5017b71f6bac.webm?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/3000d3df27fbbd57420c5017b71f6bac.mp4?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The death of her parents was only the beginning of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elena arrives at the remote island station “AURA” on her yacht. In her bag are death certificates, and in her heart is the hope of finding support from the only person close to her, her brother Ilya. But the island greets her only with the hum of generators and an icy wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ilya is somewhere here. He hears her. He leaves her notes. But with each new discovery, his explanations become stranger and stranger, and the reasons why he cannot come out into the light become more and more frightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a trail of paper letters: Ilya leads you deeper into the station, finding new excuses not to show himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the station at night: Walk through rusty laboratories and living quarters, where every creak makes you turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of AURA: What caused the staff to rush out of their posts, and why is your brother so afraid to touch the door handle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's very close. He sees everything. But are you ready to see what he has become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/cdf76840607949a9036a94d364b7ae4e.poster.avif?t=1775059936\" width=640 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/cdf76840607949a9036a94d364b7ae4e.webm?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/cdf76840607949a9036a94d364b7ae4e.mp4?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is waiting for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of interesting riddles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exciting story. You will not fully know what is happening in the game and only the ending will give you accurate answers. Only at the end will all the pieces of the plot come together into one whole</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move away objects that you can hit or fall on, because the game contains very clever jump scares that will scare you so that your chair will fall out from under you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/c5efae8424bbe72dea8a8d191ee130fd.poster.avif?t=1775059936\" width=640 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/c5efae8424bbe72dea8a8d191ee130fd.webm?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361240/extras/c5efae8424bbe72dea8a8d191ee130fd.mp4?t=1775059936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p cl